# Home Hub — copy to .env and fill in values before running docker compose
# Deploy: docker compose -f locations/home/docker-compose.yml up -d
# Backend: SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=home ./mvnw spring-boot:run

# ── Postgres ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=change_me

# ── Grafana ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GRAFANA_PASSWORD=change_me

# ── Home Assistant — home hub ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Settings → Profile → Long-Lived Access Tokens
HOME_HA_TOKEN=your_home_ha_token_here
HOME_HA_URL=http://localhost:8123

# ── Cabin HA (needed if this hub also proxies cabin devices) ──────────────────
HA_TOKEN=your_cabin_ha_token_here
HA_URL=http://cabin-hub:8123

# ── Kafka ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
KAFKA_BOOTSTRAP=localhost:9092

# ── MQTT ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
MQTT_URL=tcp://localhost:1883

# ── Familia Hub (existing Java dashboard) ────────────────────────────────────
FAMILY_DASHBOARD_URL=http://localhost:8081

# ── Reolink RLC-810A camera password ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Set on each camera via Reolink app or web UI before first use
CAMERA_PASSWORD=change_me

# ── Google OAuth (reuse smrekarfamilia@gmail.com project) ────────────────────
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
GOOGLE_CALENDAR_ID=primary

# ── Tailscale (host-level install — not in Docker) ───────────────────────────
# sudo tailscale up --advertise-routes=192.168.1.0/24 --hostname=home-hub --ssh
# After install, home-hub:8080 / home-hub:3000 / home-hub:5000 etc. are reachable
# from anywhere on the tailnet, including from the cabin-hub.
